{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>Observe.</b> This is Mishnah — you must keep it in your stomach so you not forget, as it says ״כִּי נָעִים כִּי תִשְׁמְרֵם בְּבִטְנֶךָ״ (Proverbs 22), and if you have reviewed, it is possible you will hear and fulfill — hence anything not included in Mishnah is not included in practice (see Sifrei)." "<b>All the things.</b> That a light commandment be as dear to you as a weighty commandment (there)." "<b>The good.</b> In the eyes of Heaven." "<b>And the upright.</b> In the eyes of people."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:46:52.120210421Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}